             "Reinforce Truth, ZERO-MAX, Synchro Material) passes ref = desc[+0xC], tag 0x021E8E75 (Pot of Duality, "
             "Pot of Benevolence, Spell Power Grasp) passes 0. The node MEANS nothing by itself; readers give it "
             "meaning via the kind-0xB walker `0x021A1430(side, 0xB, cid)`: "
             "(1) 1/TURN: 0x021F6DD8(desc) returns 0 when this card's own node exists. Pot of Benevolence's condition "
             "0x02201C7C skips that check when desc[+7] != 0, because its multi-select template 0x02235701 re-runs the "
             "condition AFTER the cost posted the node. "
             "(2) NO BATTLE PHASE: the gate 0x0224CD84(side) returns 0 if any of a FIXED 16-cid chain has a node: "
             "0x0EB7, 0x0EBD (both non-collectible), 0x0DDE, 0x13EB Soul Exchange, 0x1475 Makiu, 0x15F0 Thunder of Ruler, "
             "0x173F Saturn, 0x1F9A Ancient Fairy Dragon, 0x204D Skull Flame, 0x20A2 Reinforce Truth, 0x211C Silverwind, "
             "0x2276 ZERO-MAX, 0x23A6 Scrap Lube, 0x2419 Synchro Material, 0x244A Cards from the Sky, 0x24B6 Forbidden "
