             "COST: 0x021E5060 -- the function 0x021E56E9 calls after a successful selection -- does "
             "nothing BUT stamp, via `ldrb r0,[r4,#2] ; ldrb r1,[r4,#3] ; ldr r2,=0x0FB6 ; movs r3,#2 ; bl "
             "0x021C479C` at 0x021E5070..0x021E5078 with a fifth argument of 0 on the stack. CONSEQUENCE: "
             "a donor whose slot4 is 0x021E56E9 and whose slot3 is 0x021F01C1 gets a complete, correct "
             "once-per-turn ignition with NO new code.",
