             "records: Call of the Haunted, Premature Burial, Birthright, Limit Reverse, Graceful "
             "Revival, Miracle Fertilizer, Gladiator Beast Darius, Doomkaiser Dragon, ...) and "
             "slot5 GY-picker template 0x02235605. 0x02207529 is a 3-phase resolver "
             "(phase word [lit+0x70] 0x80 -> 0x7F -> 0x64) whose per-cid switch only selects a "
             "MODE in r4 and DEFAULTS TO 2 for an unrecognised cid (movs r4,#2 before the "
             "compare chain; leaves set 0/1 and rejoin at 0x022075C8), so a donor cid that the "
             "switch does not name still reaches the common body. CONSEQUENCE: a GY-revive clause "
             "needs NO new resolver code — only a criteria row (handler 0x0223C9D1 + the right "
             "criteria word) plus slot1 0x02207529 / slot5 0x02235605.",
             "B, CNT = 0x022713C4, 0x56C\n"
             "fam = set()\n"
             "for i in range(CNT):\n"
             "    if h.u32(B + i * 12 + 4, 'ov3') == 0x0223C9D1:\n"
             "        fam.add(h.u16(B + i * 12, 'ov3'))\n"
             "for cid in (0x1366, 0x137D, 0x1C4F, 0x1CFA, 0x1E30, 0x1E4A, 0x1E07, 0x2273):\n"
             "    assert cid in fam, f'{cid:#x} left the 0x0223C9D1 GY-revive family'\n"
             "# 0x02207529 is slot1 of the revive spell/trap family\n"
