             "STRB R0,[R4,#2]`, i.e. desc[+2] = event bit 31 -- and 0x021D1D56 builds bit 31 from "
             "`side << 31` where side = r7 = (w >> 9) & 1, THE OWNER "
             "(event.discard_trigger_posts_the_same_0x4E). The ACTING side is not lost: it is "
             "bit 18 of the full packed word kept at desc[+0x20] "
             "(dispatch.opponent_effect_discard_test). *** THE SAME ROUTINE PINS desc[+3]: "
             "`MOVS R2,#0x1F ; LSLS R2,R2,#0x10 ; ANDS R2,R5 ; LSRS R2,R2,#0x10 ; STRB R2,[R4,#3]` "
             "= (event >> 16) & 0x1F = the KIND, which the switch gate at 0x021D1392 forces to "
             "0x0E. 0x0E IS THE GRAVEYARD, so the native self-SS gate 0x022073F8 -- which compares "
