             "`LDR R0,[SP,#0x10] ; CMP R0,#0 ; BLE reject` -- [sp+0x10] is r3 of 0x021D1300. "
             "*** THE KIND ARITHMETIC IS THE POINT: 0x021C6B00 passes `r3 = 1 - kind` "
             "(MOV R6,#1 @0x021C6CB0 ; SUB R3,R6,R3 @0x021C6CB6), so `kind > 0` here means "
             "kind == 0 == the EFFECT discard 0x021C6D58 -> ACCEPT, while kind 1 (the COST "
             "discard 0x021C6DB4) gives 0 and kind 2 (the UI discard 0x021C6D90) gives -1, both "
