             "immediately above is the REIGN-BEAUX variant (cid 0x1B3D alone), which adds "
             "`[sp+0x20] != 0 && r4 == r7` = 'an OPPONENT's card effect did it'; (c) a "
             "records-free donor cannot get this trigger from data -- see "
