             "(0x0223CAD9), with low halves 0x0002, 0x0004 and 0x0008 -- one per declarable "
             "type, everything else controlled for. Corroborated by two single-type cards on a "
             "second handler (0x0223CBB1): Magician of Faith 0x1152 low 0x0004 ('Target 1 SPELL "
             "in your GY') and Mask of Darkness 0x100C low 0x0008 ('Target 1 TRAP in your GY'). "
             "*** CONSEQUENCE: low half 0x000E = bits 1|2|3 = 'a CARD of any type', which is how "
             "the engine spells an archetype search that may fetch Spells and Traps as well as "
             "monsters -- Toon Table of Contents 0x1562 ('Add 1 \"Toon\" CARD from your Deck to "
             "your hand') and Arsenal Summoner 0x1647 ('Add 1 \"Guardian\" CARD from your Deck') "
