             "the chain the test is SKIPPED -- then `bl 0x021A87BC(my desc)` -> r4, "
             "`bl 0x021A87BC([sp])` -> r0, and `cmp r4,r0 ; bge ; b 0x021EDC9E`: MY SPELL SPEED "
             "MUST BE >= THE ACTIVATION'S or it returns before ever reaching slot3. "
             "0x021ECC6C additionally demands `speed >= 2` outright at 0x021ECC98. "
             "*** 0x021A87BC(desc) is a per-cid switch on desc[+0] (base +/- imm, ungreppable) "
             "whose leaves also test desc[+5] and desc[+4]; its DEFAULT leaf 0x021A894C is "
             "`adds r0,r2,#0 ; bl 0x0202345C`, so a records-free donor's speed is whatever "
             "0x0202345C(cid) says. 0x0202345C (ARM9): card kind 0x17 (Spell) -> sub-type 5 "
             "(Quick-Play) = 2 else 1; kind 0x18 (Trap) -> sub-type 1 (Counter) = 3 else 2; "
             "anything else (A MONSTER) -> 2 if the cid is in the SORTED 118-entry u16 list at "
             "0x0209C118, else 1. That list is binary-searched by 0x02022E14 with the count as a "
             "HARD-CODED immediate (`movs r2,#0x76` @0x02023490), so an insert must be "
             "count-neutral and keep the sort. *** THE LIST IS 'MONSTERS WITH A QUICK EFFECT' "
