             "sites, including the getters 0x021B8014 (returns out+0x10) and 0x021B803C (out+0x14); "
             "0x021B3CE8 is its sibling. Layout: out+0x02 = the cid, out+0x10 / out+0x14 = the two "
             "stat accumulators, clamped to >= 0 at 0x021B79DE, epilogue 0x021B79F2 "
             "(`add sp,#0x1fc ; add sp,#0x8c ; pop {r3-r7,pc}`). Frame slots: [sp+0x0C] = side, "
             "[sp+0x30] = side*0xB3C, [sp+0x50] = zone*0x14. Inside its per-cid chains r2 holds the "
             "cid and r4 the running bonus. BECAUSE IT IS RE-RUN ON EVERY STAT QUERY, ANY EFFECT "
             "ROUTED THROUGH IT IS CONTINUOUS BY CONSTRUCTION — this, not the ATK/DEF delta tables, "
             "is where 'this card gains N ATK for each X' belongs (Chaos Necromancer, Maha Vailo, "
             "Cyber Blader, The Wicked Eraser, Fortune Lady Wind, Machina Cannon, field spells and "
             "continuous traps all live here).",
             "assert h.u16(0x021B44C0, 'ov3') == 0xB5F8, 'prologue push moved'\n"
             "assert h.u16(0x021B44C2, 'ov3') == 0xB0FF and h.u16(0x021B44C4, 'ov3') == 0xB0A3, \\\n"
             "    'the 0x288-byte frame setup moved'\n"
             "assert h.u16(0x021B79F2, 'ov3') == 0xB07F and h.u16(0x021B79F4, 'ov3') == 0xB023 \\\n"
