             "REGARDLESS of the shortened display name -- archetype membership is that table, not "
             "a name match, which is what made the short name acceptable. *** ov5, SO "
             "NORMAL-DUEL-ONLY, and that was forced rather than chosen: the always-resident ov3 "
             "dead-code supply is down to a 22 B contiguous maximum (escuridao, shiens_dojo x2, "
             "eclipse_wyvern x2 and handss_banish_cost hold the rest) while the two stubs need "
             "24 B + 28 B. It costs this card nothing extra because clause 2 already requires "
