             "went into 0x021B582A / 0x021B58E6 and SILENTLY CLOBBERED BOTH of shiens_dojo's "
             "claims, because stat.phantom_arm_scratch names only escuridao's claim while the "
             "authoritative free list is check_allocations.OV3_CLAIMS. READ THE LEDGER, NOT THE "
             "FACT, BEFORE CLAIMING CAVE SPACE. *** DONOR-CHOICE TRAP AVOIDED: the obvious donor "
