             "0x2389 / 0x238A / 0x238B / 0x238C it is the SECOND cls1 record, which "
             "dispatch.second_cls1_record_is_spirit_only says is unreachable for a non-Spirit.",
             "# the donor is still records-free and owns no criteria row in the CLEAN image\n"
             "for base, cnt in ((0x0227E64C, 0x51A), (0x022860D4, 0x535),\n"
