             "    'the summon-restriction cluster moved; re-derive the scan region'\n"
             "# the chosen Lightpulsar donor, Armored Lizard 0x0FD9, is clean on all four structures\n"
             "for base, cnt in ((0x0227E64C, 0x51A), (0x022860D4, 0x535),\n"
