               "(Footsoldier's) and 135 (Smoke Signal's) cards. The same comparison independently "
               "CROSS-VALIDATES counter.criteria_registry_layout: the 3DS rows for 0x1B3A "
               "{001E,0002,008C}, 0x247B {001E,0002,008C}, 0x1F76 {1B39,0802,0000} and 0x247D "
               "{001E,0002,0000} are byte-identical to the NDS rows. Practical consequence: the "
               "'Shien-name filter' and the 'dynamic level' are ONE stub, not two, and it is too "
               "big for the ov3 dead-code pool (132 B, largest contiguous block 28 B) — it needs "
               "the ov3 BSS cave, which is gated on an un-run canary. NOTE for 3DS reading: "
               "CARD_Name_E.bin is UTF-16LE and CARD_Prop.bin has NO 8-byte header (records start "
               "at offset 0), unlike the NDS files.",
               "Disassemble the 3DS bespoke handler (ARMv6) to lift the ALGORITHM only — which "
