             "your hand, Deck, or GY. You can only use 1 \"Maiden with Eyes of Blue\" effect per "
             "turn, and only once that turn.' *** DONOR: Comrade Swordsman of Landstar 0x1ED7, a "
             "vanilla L3 EARTH Warrior TUNER -- records-free in all four cls tables, the criteria "
             "registry, the effect / summon-procedure registries and the leave-mask table, with ZERO "
