             "(donor.name_slot_floor) a 24-byte name-slot floor that exactly fits the card's name in "
             "all eight languages. It is also provably absent from both named-Synchro-material "
             "predicates (tool.ungreppable_switch_overapprox), which mattered because the card is a "
             "Tuner. Retuned to LIGHT / Spellcaster / Lv1 / 0 / 0. *** THE WHOLE CARD IS TWO "
             "COUNT-NEUTRAL DATA INSERTS AND TWO SMALL ov5 STUBS -- NO overlay-3 code is edited, so "
             "it cannot disturb another patch's hooks. (a) cls1 record {0x1ED7, CAVE_MAIDEN_RES|1, "
             "0, CAVE_MAIDEN_COND|1, 0x021E51E5, 0} over phantom 0x1DB6: its mere existence is the "
