             "the attack slot; +10 is the shared costless 'you can' tag "
             "(dispatch.costless_you_can_tag). (b) criteria row {0x1ED7, aux 0x0FA7, handler "
             "0x0223E2C9, flags 0x0802} over phantom 0x1BBE = the entire 'SS 1 Blue-Eyes White "
             "Dragon from hand, Deck or GY' payload as data (dispatch.named_ss_multizone_handler), "
             "cross-confirmed against the 3DS build's own Maiden row. (c) CAVE_MAIDEN_COND: Krebons' "
             "{0x13,0x14} event-code test then Pot of Duality's turn-log query "
             "(dispatch.turnlog_once_per_turn_pair) = clause 3; returns 2 or 0. (d) CAVE_MAIDEN_RES: "
             "on phase 0x80 only (resolver.phase_protocol) it stamps the turn log, calls the "
             "cid-generic self-driven negate 0x0221F944 -- WHOSE RETURN VALUE IS THE PRINTED 'and if "
             "you do', needing no latch -- returns 0 if it did not negate, else toggles the battle "
             "position via battle.position_primitive_is_a_toggle; then EVERY phase tail-calls "
             "0x02206F41, on whose prologue switch the donor rides the default arm exactly as ten of "
             "its eleven native users do. *** DELIBERATE DEVIATIONS, all stated in the module header: "
             "CLAUSE 1 (the Quick-Effect 'targeted by a card or effect') IS NOT BUILT -- it needs a "
