             "will be a cls3 record, a DIFFERENT table, so it cannot shadow this one, and it will "
             "share the cid-keyed turn log automatically. ov5 => NORMAL-DUEL ONLY.",
             "assert h.u16(0x0221F9E4, 'ov3') == 0x7928, 'Krebons event-code gate drifted'\n"
             "# NOTE: the oracles are the STOCK images, so this proof pins the donor's\n"
