               "Card effect text: scratch/ygoprodeck_cache.json is authoritative; the ROM's "
               "cards_text.json descriptions are mistranslated and untrustworthy.",
               "Data-source discipline (CLAUDE.md / otn-effect-text-db-untrustworthy); grep the cache, "
               "never assert card text from recall.",
