             "ARM-mode access MUST split it (ADD #imm + LDR/STR residual, or two ADDs). Tried "
             "every plausible split (#0x2000/#0x2800/#0x2900 + residual, direct absolute-literal "
             "loads of all 6 AR-code target addresses and their residual offsets) across ALL 50 "
