               "phantom 0x14E7 -- the 3DS's OWN Snoww row 0 (cid 0x25F1, [1460] 000F25F1 "
               "004B1C1C 0000000E), with 3DS handler 0x004B1C1C mapped to NDS 0x0223CAF5 by "
               "Scarr 0x196A, which owns a byte-identical row in BOTH builds. (D) card_prop "
               "promotion to Effect Monster 1700/0 plus name/description.\n"
               "*** ⚠️ ov3, NOT ov5: 0x021D1300 is shared engine code that runs in puzzles, "
