               "one leaf changed (0x1C18: reject -> 0x021D185C) and that Lich Lord and all six "
               "native Dark World monsters keep theirs.\n"
               "*** TEST ROM: _build_snoww.py chains gates_of_dark_world then snoww "
               "onto the clean ROM and runs BOTH verify()s against the final image. Gates is in "
               "it because its clause-2 EFFECT discard (mover 0x021C6D58, kind 0) is the in-ROM "
               "way to reach the arm on demand. NOT wired into apply_all_patches.\n"
               "*** TESTING CLAUSE 2 NEEDS THE OPPONENT TO DISCARD YOUR SNOWW: Card Destruction "
               "0x12D5 is a confirmed kind-0 caller of the EFFECT mover 0x021C6D58 "
               "(dispatch.three_hand_to_gy_movers), so an opponent deck stacked with it is the "
               "cheap way to reach the trigger.",
