             "shares the pointer: +04 0x02230EBC is the RESOLVER, a 0x7E/0x7F/0x80 phase machine "
             "-- ⚠️ **NOT REUSABLE**, see dispatch.resolver_hardcodes_printed_damage: it holds no "
             "cid literal and no cid compare, which is NOT the same as being effect-agnostic, "
