             "(dispatch.cls2_slot8_is_candidate_filter); +0C 0x021F44D8 is the 'may this GY "
             "effect be offered' gate (dispatch.gy_offer_free_zone_triple); and +10 0x021EB1B0 is "
             "THE SHARED 'return 1 monster you control to the hand' COST MACHINE -- a 3-phase "
