             "on its early-out path (`cmp r3,r2 ; bne ; movs r0,#1 ; pop`). CONSEQUENCE: when a "
             "donor carries a slot4 for one clause but must present 'no cost' for another, the "
             "no-cost arm returns 1 -- it CANNOT simply mirror the absent-slot value of 0 that "
             "the record would hold if the slot were null.",
