             "FIELD zone 0x0A) take a short tail at 0x021B07EA. Consequences, and they are the "
             "point of this fact: (a) safe_zone's link 0x021B05CC (`bl 0x021A0950`, Heart "
             "of Clear Water) and Dreadmaster's 0x021B05FA are AFTER the split on the monster "
             "side, so NEITHER is ever reached for a Spell/Trap target -- do not try to protect "
             "a Spell/Trap there; (b) azure_eyes' link 0x021B0592 (`bl 0x021A1430`) sits "
             "BEFORE the split, so it IS reached for Spell/Trap slots too; (c) a Spell/Trap "
             "protection belongs in the tail, where rider.st_tail_protection_links documents the "
             "two family-1 links. The slot map 0-4 monster / 5-9 Spell+Trap / 0x0A Field is "
             "corroborated by 0x021AD234, which loops r4 = 5 while r4 < 0x0A, and by "
             "rider.shadow_spell_observed ('side 0, slot 7 = a Spell/Trap zone').",
