             "and each arm returns 'am I busy'. With A = 0x0229AAFC (action ctx), "
             "B = 0x0229A9FC (queue ctx), C = 0x0229DD94, D = 0x0229ABFC (AI phase ctx): "
             "[A+0x6C] != 0 -> return 0 (blocked); [A+0x5C] != 0 -> 0x021D3E78 sub-dispatcher; "
             "[A+0x64] != 0 -> 0x021D49D4 THE EXECUTOR (opcode VM on [A+0x68]); "
             "0x022481C0() != 0 -> return 1, THE REACTIVE 181-RULE SCAN over table 0x02275510; "
             "[B+0x54] != 0 -> 0x021D6B44 queue compactor; then [C+0x20] = 0 and "
             "[D+0x60] != 0 -> 0x0223A1C4 THE PHASE SCHEDULER (the proactive path). "
             "*** ORDER MATTERS FOR ANY MODIFICATION: the reactive rule table is polled BEFORE "
