             "BOTH do nothing if [C+0x34] != 0. *** PUSH 0x021D28A4: if [0x0229DD14+0x64] != 0 AND "
             "[0x0229911C + 4*[0x0229DD14+0x38]] == 2 (the per-seat controller-mode word of the player in "
             "[0x0229DD14+0x38] is 2) it does [C+0x28] += 1 and posts BL 0x0219EA84(8, -1, &u16 = 1, 2). "
             "Otherwise old = [C+0x28]; [C+0x28] = old + 1; and ONLY IF old == 0 it also zeroes [C+0x30] and "
             "[0x0229ABFC+0x60] and does [C+0x2C] += 1. *** POP 0x021D2964: same two guards; the mode-2 branch does "
             "[C+0x28] -= 1 and posts 0x0219EA84(8, -1, &u16 = 0, 2); otherwise it just does [C+0x28] -= 1. "
