             "0x02243F38(side, cid, param, idx); returns the signed s16 C.count. So a cid with NO criteria row returns 0 and leaves the "
             "buffer count 0. THE SHARED RUNNER 0x02243F38(side, cid, param, idx): saves the old count; if C+8 == 0 and the seat-mode "
             "word [0x0229911C + 4*side] == 1 it first calls 0x0226B6C0() (pre-hook, result kept); then row = 0x022713C4 + 12*idx and "
             "`blx [0x022713C8 + 12*idx]` -- the row's handler word -- with (row, side, param); then, under the same two conditions, "
