    # -- Immortal Phoenix Gearfried (2026-11-04) ---------------------------------------------------
    # Whole card in-game confirmed by user 2026-11-04 ("I confirm all of gearfrieds effects work!") on
    # rom_immortal_phoenix_gearfried.nds b1b6bb90...8ea0; NOT shipped. The facts below are STATIC (stock-image) proofs of the
    # sites the card relies on; the behaviour is the user's confirmation, not an automated check.
    anchor("dispatch.monster_effect_activation_predicate_0x021D2AD8", "effect_dispatch_tables",
           "0x021D2AD8(act) = 'THIS ACTIVATION IS A MONSTER EFFECT'. act[+3] is the activating card's ZONE (desc decode of 0x021D3168: "
           "bits 16..20): zone <= 4 -> 1; zone 5..0xA (S/T, Field) -> 0; zone > 0xA (hand, GY, ...) -> 1 iff the cid act[+0] is a monster "
           "(0x02029E60|1) or the [act+0xC] card-word test passes. It is the second precondition of Divine Wrath's cond dispatcher "
           "0x021F89A8 and the test Gearfried's C3 'when a monster effect is activated' quick negate uses in place of Wall/Qoatlus' "
           "Spell/Trap test; Wall's `[act+3] <= 0xA` guard is a zone test, which is why it never sees monster effects. "
           "Whole Gearfried card in-game confirmed by user 2026-11-04.",
           0x021D2AD8, "ov3", ["notes/immortal-phoenix-gearfried-findings.md", "otn_enhanced/cards/immortal_phoenix_gearfried.py"], n=32)

